    <briefdescription>
<para>Quadratic surface function defined by four corner values. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class interpolates a surface across the bounding box domain using bilinear/quadratic interpolation from four corner elevations: c00 (bottom-left), c10 (bottom-right), c01 (top-left), and c11 (top-right). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
